<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1350129438"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537902977"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="REMEMBER"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="SawanoHiroyuki[nZk] / 瑞葵(mizuki) / Yosh / R!N/Gemie / Tielle / naNami"/><amll:meta key="album" value="R∃/MEMBER"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:09.000"><div begin="00:20.232" end="04:21.148"><p begin="00:20.232" end="00:24.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">手を止めた一秒で変わるはずないと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认定不可能在停止的一秒内</span></p><p begin="00:24.532" end="00:26.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">気を緩めた後ろで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在我放松警惕的下一秒</span></p><p begin="00:26.917" end="00:28.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">連れ添う音が逃げていく Oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾亲密无间的声音却逃离我而去</span></p><p begin="00:30.468" end="00:32.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">君は黙って見ていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你沉默地注视着这一切</span></p><p begin="00:34.385" end="00:36.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">破けたページの所為で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同书页破损</span></p><p begin="00:36.832" end="00:39.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">先が読めないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而无法继续阅读一般</span></p><p begin="00:40.612" end="00:44.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">このまま一つの物語抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅怀抱着最初的那个故事</span></p><p begin="00:45.430" end="00:47.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">エンドロール見返してても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算反复回看片末名单</span></p><p begin="00:47.931" end="00:49.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">人が過ぎていくだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也终究会与人们擦肩而过</span></p><p begin="00:50.518" end="00:54.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">大人の言い訳にもたれ掛かる前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在依赖成年人的辩解之前</span></p><p begin="00:55.716" end="00:57.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Remember<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请铭记</span></p><p begin="00:58.451" end="00:58.947" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="00:59.074" end="01:00.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I will never give it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远不会放弃</span></p><p begin="01:00.973" end="01:01.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">All the spirit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的灵魂都将自由翱翔</span></p><p begin="01:01.709" end="01:02.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">is gonna let it fly</p><p begin="01:03.476" end="01:05.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">強がった日の言葉が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逞强的日子里的豪言</span></p><p begin="01:06.009" end="01:09.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">錆びた夢の体をまだ支えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还在支撑着梦想那锈蚀的躯体</span></p><p begin="01:09.795" end="01:10.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Running circles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兜兜转转只为实现心底属于自己的梦</span></p><p begin="01:10.343" end="01:11.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">around what is mine</p><p begin="01:12.115" end="01:12.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I'm getting closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天 我都离目标更近一步</span></p><p begin="01:12.962" end="01:13.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">as I move in time</p><p begin="01:14.445" end="01:16.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Wo-Oh…</p><p begin="01:19.463" end="01:20.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Let'em know!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉他们</span></p><p begin="01:20.780" end="01:22.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Oh, let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="01:22.530" end="01:23.983" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Oh, let it shine my friend!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒 我的朋友</span></p><p begin="01:24.110" end="01:28.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">そう 誰の弱さも前に繋げる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 我们的脆弱终将带领我们前往未来</span></p><p begin="01:29.380" end="01:31.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">You remember, purest heart?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你记得那最纯洁的心吗</span></p><p begin="01:32.154" end="01:34.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">And the beauty of the colors<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那绚丽的色彩</span></p><p begin="01:34.554" end="01:38.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Wo-Oh…</p><p begin="01:40.523" end="01:41.759" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Wasn't feeling right and<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝望的我</span></p><p begin="01:41.968" end="01:44.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">all of the gravity tore me down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉这世界快要将我击溃</span></p><p begin="01:44.502" end="01:46.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I needed to figure dilemmas out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要尽快走出困境</span></p><p begin="01:46.952" end="01:47.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Just wanted to break out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想冲破一切阻碍</span></p><p begin="01:48.071" end="01:49.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">of borderlands</p><p begin="01:49.279" end="01:49.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">And shout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声呐喊</span></p><p begin="01:50.412" end="01:51.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Now it's getting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今希望渐渐浮现 我知道原因</span></p><p begin="01:51.089" end="01:52.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">clear and I know why</p><p begin="01:54.456" end="01:55.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">I feel all the waves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感受到了内心的波动</span></p><p begin="01:55.570" end="01:56.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">It opens up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界豁然开朗</span></p><p begin="01:56.854" end="01:58.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">I throw up my fist to<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我高高举起紧握的拳头</span></p><p begin="01:58.191" end="01:58.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">punch the air</p><p begin="02:00.550" end="02:02.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">And the sun will shine forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">太阳将永远光芒万丈</span></p><p begin="02:02.901" end="02:04.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">We can feel this even better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们会看到更加美好的明天</span></p><p begin="02:05.418" end="02:05.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">See the sky,<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看 天空越来越明亮</span></p><p begin="02:06.259" end="02:07.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">it's looking brighter</p><p begin="02:07.446" end="02:08.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">We have begun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们已经开始更深入地思考</span></p><p begin="02:08.668" end="02:10.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">to think much deeper now</p><p begin="02:10.424" end="02:10.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Hear the praise<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听听这些赞扬</span></p><p begin="02:11.157" end="02:12.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">I'm getting higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉无比快乐</span></p><p begin="02:12.941" end="02:14.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">But I must control the fire.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我必须控制激动的心情</span></p><p begin="02:15.673" end="02:17.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Keep my cool.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持镇静</span></p><p begin="02:18.392" end="02:18.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="02:19.009" end="02:20.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">I will never give it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远不会放弃</span></p><p begin="02:20.892" end="02:21.737" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">All the spirit is<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的灵魂都将自由翱翔</span></p><p begin="02:21.747" end="02:22.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">gonna let it fly</p><p begin="02:23.431" end="02:23.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">And you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道 泪水终究会干涸</span></p><p begin="02:24.037" end="02:25.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">every tear is gonna dry</p><p begin="02:25.921" end="02:26.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">And the moon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月亮会在夜空闪烁</span></p><p begin="02:26.571" end="02:27.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">will shimmer in the sky</p><p begin="02:28.005" end="02:29.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">Shimmer. Shimmer for me!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪烁 为我闪烁</span></p><p begin="02:29.738" end="02:30.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">Running circles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兜兜转转只为实现心底属于自己的梦</span></p><p begin="02:30.273" end="02:31.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">around what is mine</p><p begin="02:31.974" end="02:32.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">I'm getting closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天 我都离目标更近一步</span></p><p begin="02:32.933" end="02:33.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">as I move in time</p><p begin="02:34.483" end="02:36.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">Just shine all you want!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情绽放光芒吧</span></p><p begin="02:36.950" end="02:38.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">Just shine all you can!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情绽放光芒吧</span></p><p begin="02:39.451" end="02:40.137" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">Let'em know!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉他们</span></p><p begin="02:40.651" end="02:41.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">Oh, let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="02:42.134" end="02:43.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">Oh, let it shine my friend!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒 我的朋友</span></p><p begin="02:44.285" end="02:45.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">So, let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="02:45.688" end="02:47.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">So, let it fly!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 放飞心灵</span></p><p begin="02:47.638" end="02:48.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">Don't look back again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再回首过去</span></p><p begin="02:49.507" end="02:51.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">You remember, purest heart?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你记得那最纯洁的心吗</span></p><p begin="02:51.991" end="02:54.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">And the beauty of the colors<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那绚丽的色彩</span></p><p begin="02:54.491" end="02:56.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">They ran in the rain!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们在雨中奔跑</span></p><p begin="02:56.975" end="02:58.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">They ran in the rain!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们在雨中奔跑</span></p><p begin="03:20.892" end="03:22.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">奏でた音が今まだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算奏响的乐音如今</span></p><p begin="03:23.412" end="03:25.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">背で返されたとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度从身后传来 飘回耳畔</span></p><p begin="03:25.981" end="03:27.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">未来(あす)の指が触れれば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若未来就在我触手可及的地方</span></p><p begin="03:28.470" end="03:32.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L80">出遅れたその足と歩き出すから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与缓慢的步伐一同迈步向前</span></p><p begin="03:32.200" end="03:32.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L81">Running circles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兜兜转转只为实现心底属于自己的梦</span></p><p begin="03:32.800" end="03:34.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L82">around what is mine</p><p begin="03:34.539" end="03:35.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L83">I'm getting closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天 我都离目标更近一步</span></p><p begin="03:35.537" end="03:36.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L84">as I move in time</p><p begin="03:36.970" end="03:38.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L85">Wo-Oh…</p><p begin="03:40.842" end="03:41.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L86">Let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="03:41.475" end="03:42.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L87">I will never give it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远不会放弃</span></p><p begin="03:43.409" end="03:44.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L88">All the spirit is<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的灵魂都将自由翱翔</span></p><p begin="03:44.230" end="03:45.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L89">gonna let it fly</p><p begin="03:45.930" end="03:46.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L90">And you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道 泪水终究会干涸</span></p><p begin="03:46.541" end="03:47.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L91">every tear is gonna dry</p><p begin="03:48.395" end="03:48.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L92">And the moon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月亮会在夜空闪烁</span></p><p begin="03:48.995" end="03:50.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L93">will shimmer in the sky</p><p begin="03:50.428" end="03:51.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L94">Shimmer. Shimmer for me!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪烁 为我闪烁</span></p><p begin="03:52.163" end="03:52.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L95">Running circles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兜兜转转只为实现心底属于自己的梦</span></p><p begin="03:52.809" end="03:53.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L96">around what is mine</p><p begin="03:54.493" end="03:55.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L97">I'm getting closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天 我都离目标更近一步</span></p><p begin="03:55.486" end="03:56.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L98">as I move in time</p><p begin="03:57.052" end="03:58.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L99">Just shine all you want!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情绽放光芒吧</span></p><p begin="03:59.454" end="04:01.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L100">Just shine all you can!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情绽放光芒吧</span></p><p begin="04:01.971" end="04:02.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L101">Let'em know!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉他们</span></p><p begin="04:03.104" end="04:04.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L102">Oh, let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="04:04.821" end="04:06.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L103">Oh, let it shine my friend!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放光芒 我的朋友</span></p><p begin="04:06.705" end="04:07.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L104">So, let it shine!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 绽放光芒</span></p><p begin="04:08.088" end="04:09.658" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L105">So, let it fly!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 放飞心灵</span></p><p begin="04:10.139" end="04:11.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L106">Don't look back again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再回首过去</span></p><p begin="04:11.989" end="04:13.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L107">You remember, purest heart?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你记得那最纯洁的心吗</span></p><p begin="04:14.490" end="04:16.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L108">And the beauty of the colors<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那绚丽的色彩</span></p><p begin="04:16.990" end="04:18.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L109">They ran in the rain!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们在雨中奔跑</span></p><p begin="04:19.457" end="04:21.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L110">They ran in the rain!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们在雨中奔跑</span></p></div></body></tt>